 result←object Eject arg
 :If ×≢arg
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Eject'##.##.Error~##.##.IsInt arg
     '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: Eject'##.##.Error 1<≢arg
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Eject'##.##.Error~0 1∊⍨arg←⊃arg
 :EndIf
 ⍝object._page←object ⎕VGET⊂'_page' 0 ⍝? This initialization shouldn't be needed here any more
 :If arg←⊃arg,0 ⍝ If 1, override 'dirty' check
 :OrIf object dirty ⍬
     _supp.WritePage object ⍝ Flush the Bitmap to the Printer page & empty it
     2 ##.##.∆NQ object'NewPage'
     object._page←1+object._page
 :EndIf
 object.(_position _dirty)←(0 0)0
 'Page'##.##.Event object ##.##.Application object._page
 result←##.NoRes
